​ ```
3. `cbor_value_at_end`
​ `cbor_value_at_end()` checks whether a `CborValue` iterator has no remaining items in the current container. Use it to stop iterating arrays/maps. It returns `true` when `it->remaining == 0`, otherwise `false`.
​ Its signature is:
