2. `cbor_value_get_int`
​ `cbor_value_get_int` extracts a CBOR integer into `int`. Use it only when `cbor_value_is_integer(value)` is true. It writes the converted value to `*result`; if the CBOR item is negative, it returns `-(n+1)`. Always returns `CborNoError` here.
​ Its signature is:
