​ ```
5. `cbor_value_get_int_checked`
​ `cbor_value_get_int_checked()` safely extracts a CBOR integer into `int`. Use it on an integer `CborValue`; it returns `CborNoError` on success, or `CborErrorDataTooLarge` if the value can’t fit in `int`. Negative values are handled carefully before conversion.
​ Its signature is:
​ ```c
