​ ```
4. `cbor_value_validate`
​ `cbor_value_validate` checks that the CBOR item at `it` is well-formed under `flags`. It copies the iterator, validates via `validate_value`, and doesn’t advance `*it`. If `CborValidateCompleteData` is set, any unread trailing bytes cause `CborErrorGarbageAtEnd`; otherwise returns `CborNoError` or the validation error.
​ Its signature is:
​ ```c
