## Target API Functions

1. `cbor_value_get_text_string_chunk`
​ Returns one chunk of a text string. Use it only on a text-string `CborValue`; it asserts that precondition. It fills `bufferptr`/`len` with the chunk data and `next` with the next item, and delegates to `_cbor_value_get_string_chunk`.
​ Its signature is:
